    {
      "source": "Managed resources can access a <code>NotificationPublisher</code> by\nimplementing the <a href=\"NotificationPublisherAware.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.jmx.export.notification\"><code>NotificationPublisherAware</code></a> interface. After a particular\nmanaged resource instance is registered with the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/MBeanServer.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>MBeanServer</code></a>,\nSpring will inject a <code>NotificationPublisher</code> instance into it if that\nresource implements the <a href=\"NotificationPublisherAware.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.jmx.export.notification\"><code>NotificationPublisherAware</code></a> interface.",
      "translation": "托管资源可以通过实现<a href=\"NotificationPublisherAware.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.jmx.export.notification\"><code>NotificationPublisherAware</code></a>接口来访问<code>NotificationPublisher</code>。在将特定的托管资源实例注册到<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/MBeanServer.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>MBeanServer</code></a>之后，如果该资源实现了<code>NotificationPublisherAware</code>接口，Spring 将向其注入一个<code>NotificationPublisher</code>实例。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Each managed resource instance will have a distinct instance of a\n<code>NotificationPublisher</code> implementation. This instance will keep\ntrack of all the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/NotificationListener.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>NotificationListeners</code></a>\nregistered for a particular managed resource.",
      "translation": "每个托管资源实例都将拥有一个独立的`NotificationPublisher`实现实例。该实例将跟踪为特定托管资源注册的所有<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/NotificationListener.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>NotificationListeners</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Any existing, user-defined MBeans should use standard JMX APIs for notification\npublication; this interface is intended for use only by Spring-created MBeans.",
      "translation": "任何现有的、用户定义的 MBean 都应使用标准的 JMX API 进行通知发布；此接口仅由 Spring 创建的 MBean 使用。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Send the specified <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/Notification.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>Notification</code></a> to all registered\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/NotificationListener.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>NotificationListeners</code></a>.\nManaged resources are <strong>not</strong> responsible for managing the list\nof registered <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/NotificationListener.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>NotificationListeners</code></a>;\nthat is performed automatically.",
      "translation": "将指定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/Notification.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>Notification</code></a> 发送给所有已注册的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/NotificationListener.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>NotificationListeners</code></a>。\n托管资源<strong>不</strong>负责管理已注册的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/NotificationListener.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>NotificationListeners</code></a> 列表；该操作会自动执行。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"UnableToSendNotificationException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.jmx.export.notification\">UnableToSendNotificationException</a></code> - if sending failed",
      "translation": "<code><a href=\"UnableToSendNotificationException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.jmx.export.notification\">UnableToSendNotificationException</a></code> - 如果发送失败",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>notification</code> - the JMX Notification to send",
      "translation": "<code>notification</code> - 要发送的 JMX 通知",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Send the specified <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/Notification.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>Notification</code></a> to all registered\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/NotificationListener.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>NotificationListeners</code></a>.",
      "translation": "将指定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/Notification.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>Notification</code></a> 发送给所有已注册的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/NotificationListener.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>NotificationListeners</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "This is a functional interface and can therefore be used as the assignment target for a lambda expression or method reference.",
      "translation": "这是一个功能接口，因此可用作 Lambda 表达式或方法引用的赋值目标。",
      "count": 1
    },
